 "Every event carries a provenance: {canonical}, {visual}, {inferred}, {reconstructed} or {unresolved}. Movement between known points may be interpolated, and is labelled. Nothing is invented as canon.": "每個事件都標有出處類別：{canonical}、{visual}、{inferred}、{reconstructed} 或 {unresolved}。已知地點之間的移動可能經過內插，並會註明，絕不把杜撰的內容當作原作。",
 "Every figure is summed from event-level records. See the dossiers for sources.": "所有數字皆由事件層級的紀錄加總而來，出處請見各檔案。",
 "Every tick is an event, the coloured bands are the stages of the war. Click anywhere to jump there, or drag to scrub. Rewinding shows exactly what happened, nothing is lost.": "每個刻度都是一個事件，彩色色帶是戰爭的各個階段。點擊任意位置就能跳過去，拖曳可以來回快轉倒轉。倒回去看到的就是當時發生的一切，什麼都不會遺失。",
 "Everything on the map comes with its source, and anything reconstructed says so. Have fun exploring.": "地圖上的所有內容都附有出處，推測重建的部分也會註明。盡情探索吧！",
