 "Gradient": "漸層",
 "Ground taken and lost as the armies move: it stays held until retaken, cut off or returned, and the front moves with the clock. RECONSTRUCTED from recorded positions and strengths (the novels draw no front line). Campaign-wide, so force filters do not change it.": "隨軍隊移動而奪取與失去的地區：在被奪回、切斷或歸還前會一直保持，戰線隨時間推移。由紀錄的位置與兵力重建（小說中並未畫出戰線），作用於整個戰役，因此部隊篩選不會改變它。",
 "Ground taken around the armies. It stays taken after they move on, until it is retaken, cut off or returned at the end of hostilities.": "軍隊周邊奪取的地區。軍隊離開後仍會保持，直到被奪回、被切斷，或在敵對行動結束時歸還。",
