 "History on the record": "紀錄中的歷史",
 "Hit this (or Space) and the war starts moving. Armies march, fronts shift, numbers roll. Press it again to pause anywhere.": "點這裡（或按 Space），戰爭就動起來了。軍隊行進，戰線推移，數字跳動。再點一下，隨時都能暫停。",
 "Hostilities ended": "敵對行動結束",
 "I hope the Tensura production team gets to see this project of mine someday.": "希望有一天，轉生史萊姆的製作團隊能看到我的這個作品。",
 "I love the Tempest–Eastern Empire war arc, so I read volumes 12 to 16 again with a notebook open and turned the war into a map you can play like a documentary. Every movement, battle and loss is placed from the novels. Where the books are silent, the map says so.": "我超喜歡 Tempest–Eastern Empire 戰爭篇，所以翻開筆記本，把第 12 到 16 集重讀了一遍，把這場戰爭做成一張可以像紀錄片一樣播放的地圖。每一次行軍、每一場戰鬥、每一次損失都依小說擺放，書裡沒寫的地方，地圖上也會老實說明。",
