 "That theatre is not on the record.": "紀錄中沒有這個戰區。",
 "That’s it, enjoy the war!": "就這樣啦，好好享受這場戰爭吧！",
 "The armies": "各路大軍",
 "The atlas renders with WebGL. Enable hardware acceleration, or open it in a browser that supports WebGL 2.": "本圖集使用 WebGL 算繪。請啟用硬體加速，或使用支援 WebGL 2 的瀏覽器開啟。",
 "The campaign atlas lives at the root of this site.": "戰役圖集位於本站首頁。",
 "The campaign dataset did not load": "戰役資料集無法載入",
 "The campaign in stages. Pick one to move there. Play to watch it unfold on the map.": "分階段呈現的戰役。選擇一個階段即可跳轉，按下播放即可在地圖上觀看其展開。",
 "The capital of a nation, inside its outline.": "一國的首都，位於其輪廓內。",
 "The clean Base Map for following the war, or the painted Myth Map for the world itself. Switching keeps your place in time.": "想跟著戰局走就用簡潔的 Base Map，想看看這個世界就用手繪風的 Myth Map。切換時時間位置不變。",
 "The drawn area is schematic: the supplied maps show no theatre boundaries. It is clipped to the traced national borders so it never crosses into the sea or a neighbouring state.": "所繪範圍僅為示意：提供的地圖上沒有戰區邊界。範圍已依描出的國界裁切，因此不會越入海洋或鄰國。",
 "The edge of held ground. It moves with the clock, forwards and backwards.": "控制區的邊緣，隨時間前後移動。",
 "The event is canonical. Its exact position, path or timing on this map is reconstructed.": "事件本身來自原作，它在本地圖上的確切位置、路徑或時間為重建。",
 "The evidence is insufficient. Shown so the gap stays visible.": "證據不足。仍予以顯示，好讓空白保持可見。",
 "The five covers of this war’s volumes, made into wallpapers, plus two moments from the map. Tap to save.": "本場戰爭五集的封面製成的桌布，另有兩幅來自地圖的畫面。點按即可儲存。",
 "The map could not start": "地圖無法啟動",
 "The map could not start.": "地圖無法啟動。",
 "The map is a fictional world. Borders are traced from the supplied Base Map. Positions are simulation coordinates, never latitude and longitude. Unknown numbers stay unknown and are never shown as zero.": "這張地圖描繪的是虛構世界。邊界描自提供的 Base Map，位置是模擬座標，而非經緯度。未知的數字保持未知，絕不顯示為零。",
 "The novels give no clock times or calendar dates. Battle days (D−, D+) count from first contact. Every HH:MM is a simulation placement on a 10-minute grid, and the “year 9001” calendar is an artificial marker.": "小說中沒有提供具體時刻或日曆日期。戰鬥日（D−、D+）從首次接觸起算，所有 HH:MM 都是 10 分鐘網格上的模擬設定，「9001 年」曆法只是人為標記。",
 "The number is stated by the source.": "該數字由資料明確給出。",
 "The painted world map, for geographic and lore context.": "手繪世界地圖，用於了解地理與世界觀。",
 "The pale strip is ground about to change hands. The winner's colour follows it in from the front.": "淺色帶是即將易手的地區，勝方的顏色會從戰線一側滲入。",
 "The runtime dataset is generated at build time. Run the compile and validate steps, then reload.": "執行階段資料集於建置時產生。請執行編譯與驗證步驟，然後重新載入。",
 "The Situation panel tells you who is up against whom, how many have fallen and what just happened. Click any name to open its full file.": "態勢面板會告訴你誰在和誰對陣、倒下了多少人、剛剛發生了什麼。點擊任何名字即可開啟完整檔案。",
 "The span is derived from the events assigned to the battle. The source gives no start or end time.": "時間跨度依分配給該戰鬥的事件推算，資料未提供開始或結束時間。",
